    "updated_at": "2016-09-08T10:30:08Z",
    "body": "The time was around 2008 I believe. I don't think there is any interest in changing it at this point, it is interoperably implemented.\n\n`innerHTML` parses a string when you _set_ it, not when you get it.\n",
