    "updated_at": "2016-09-08T15:02:34Z",
    "body": "That example is using XML syntax, not HTML syntax, so HTML parsing rules do not apply.\n\nAs far as I can tell there isn't an issue in the HTML standard, so I will close this, but I am happy to continue discussing in the closed issue. If you can convince two or more browser vendors to change their HTML parsers in this area, we can reopen. Thanks 🙂\n",
